{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And Joshua heard.</b> For he remained at the bottom of the mountain." "<b>ברעה.</b> Derived from תרועה, just as אשא דעי (Job 36:3) is from ידע; so too from רעה one says ירע, and similar is למה תריעי רֵעַ (Micah 4:9)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:44.808136466Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}